  - github.com/hashicorp/terraform-plugin-sdk, terraform-plugin-go,
    terraform-plugin-log, hcl, errwrap, go-multierror, go-uuid,
    go-version and logutils.

  gaps-gcp modifies none of these files. Their source is at the module
